                                <marker start="24024/24000s" duration="1001/24000s" value="G1 · Lower third: Leo Dion (Semibold 88) / Indie developer, BrightDigit (Regular 60, 70%). x 288, title baseline y 1860, 6 px #6B8FF8 bar"/>
                                <marker start="48048/24000s" duration="1001/24000s" value="Export · Burned-in captions: check they clear the G1 lower third (0:01–0:06)" completed="0"/>
